--[[
================================================================================

        A C H I E V E M E N T   C O N F I G

        Every achievement in Gradish mode, in one file. Edit here and nothing
        else needs touching -- the entity scripts no longer carry their own
        wording.

        HOW IT WORKS
        ------------
        GradishCore fetches this once per session and looks entities up by the
        name in their profile. An entity with no block here still gets all four
        achievements, generated from its name.

        Each entry takes four fields:

            Identifier   unique key. Changing it makes it a NEW achievement,
                         so someone who already earned the old one keeps both.
            Title        the headline in the popup
            Desc         the line under the title
            Reason       the hint shown for one you do not own yet

        Image is per entity and applies to all four of that entity's
        achievements unless one overrides it. Better still: drop a file in
        ImagesA/ named after the entity, containing one line:

            return "rbxassetid://133397789900538"
            return "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/you/repo/main/rose.png"
            return "myimages/rose.png"

        It works out which of the three it is. ImagesA wins over Image here.

        SHORT FORM. A badge can be one string instead of a four-field table:

            ["Corrode"] = {
                Survive = "Survived Corrode | Slow, but the floor remembers him",
                Death   = "Dissolved | It was not him that got you, it was the floor",
            },

        Title before the pipe, description after. Identifier and Reason are
        derived. The blocks below stay in long form on purpose -- they carry
        Identifiers that do not match the derived ones ("Corrosion", not
        "Corrode"), and changing an Identifier orphans a badge somebody has
        already earned.

        To switch one off entirely, set it to false:
            Untouched = false,

================================================================================
]]

